msgid "  More than two channels go to auphonic.com as one: the fold is only switched off for stereo.\n  Where the channels are meant to stay apart, cut the file into tracks first."
msgstr "  Daugiau nei du kanalai į auphonic.com siunčiami kaip vienas: sujungimas išjungiamas tik stereo atveju.\n  Jei kanalai turi likti atskiri, pirmiausia supjaustykite failą į takelius."

